{"duration_api_ms":138482,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0204548c-a824-57b7-bea3-1783011bc81a","total_cost_usd":1.1451400000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":62,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54287,"cache_read_input_tokens":2097389,"output_tokens":14531,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2376},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54287,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1154,"cache_read_input_tokens":85933,"cache_creation_input_tokens":608,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":608},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":62,"outputTokens":14531,"cacheReadInputTokens":2097389,"cacheCreationInputTokens":54287,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.1446418000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":2376,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":54287,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":2147,"outputTokens":567,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0004982000000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":539,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":31,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I've diagnosed both suites. Both fail because of bugs in the tests, not in the product or the environment, so neither can go green without editing the sdkjs test files, which are outside this packet's target. The acceptance oracle passes: 6/6 suites, 10066/10323 assertions, now in about 29 s instead of about 130 s. `theseus validate` reports 0 errors and 2 warnings, which I didn't look into. Everything is committed as 5ba14b6.\n\n**color-mods: the test expects Office's rounding.**\n- I logged every failed assertion with its actual and expected value. All 257 are off by exactly 1 on a single 0–255 colour channel.\n- sdkjs computes colours with full decimal precision, while the expected values follow Office's whole-number rounding. For example, alphaMod 25% of 128 gives exactly 32 in sdkjs; the test expects 31.\n- The test file has a tolerance switch (`IS_APPROX_EQUALS`), but it is turned off and only covers the red, green and blue channels, not alpha.\n\n**chartEx-serialize: it hangs at load every time; it is not just slow.**\n- The page never loads `common/AllFonts.js`. Creating the editor API throws in the font setup, inside the page's startup handler, before the tests are scheduled.\n- That means QUnit is never started, so the run waits until the timeout.\n- As an experiment I injected an empty font list. The suite then finishes in about 3 s but fails all 13 assertions, for two reasons:\n  - The page loads the cell, slide and word editor scripts together, which declare the same globals twice (12 script errors).\n  - The chart object has no XML read/write code (`fromXml`/`toXml`), so serialising it crashes. The test was adapted from a Visio (vsdx) test and targets a chart XML serialiser this codebase doesn't have.\n\n**Decisions:**\n- Both suites stay on the oracle's \"known broken\" list, still checked to fail exactly as recorded.\n- Because the chartEx hang happens at load, I cut its wait from 120 s to 20 s. That is where the time saving comes from.\n- The diagnosis is written in `.theseus/oracle/sdkjs-common-run.cjs`, the Atlas card `sdkjs-common.md` and the packet's Executor log. My friction line is appended.\n- I filed a low-priority follow-up request in `.theseus/spawn/` (requires the browser) to fix the two test pages:\n  - color-mods: accept a difference of 1 on all four channels.\n  - chartEx: add the font stub, load only the scripts it needs, and skip the XML comparison with a stated reason.\n- No sdkjs file was changed.\n\n**Surprise:** the packet says to reproduce with `ORACLE_ALL=1`, but the oracle never reads that variable. Passing the suite name alone (e.g. `.theseus/oracle/sdkjs-common.sh color-mods`) is enough.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas:**\n- When a QUnit page waits for a manual start and throws before starting, it looks exactly like a timeout. Logging page errors and each assertion is how to tell a hang from a slow run.\n- Any sdkjs test page that creates the editor API needs `AllFonts.js`, or at least an empty font list.\n- Colour-mod mismatches of 1 are rounding differences, not a colour defect.","ttft_ms":1664,"type":"result","duration_ms":397630,"uuid":"673f5f8c-ee67-4746-827b-0b31b4881694","ttft_stream_ms":818,"time_to_request_ms":304,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":3,"system_prompt":180,"resume_other":1,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":29,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":7,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":7,"init_frame_send":6,"engine_pickup":5,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":10,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":10,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":21,"message_normalization":1,"client_creation":1,"request_build":6},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":30,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":150,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_